  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Enhancing Skills Development for Sustainable Job Creation and Trade Programme in Eswatini</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to unlock private sector-led job creation and enterprise development in Eswatini, focusing on sectors with high growth potential. This will be achieved through three interconnected pillars: 1) Human capital transformation by equipping youth with market-driven skills for jobs in priority sectors; 2) Enterprise development through support to business management, investment facilitation and technology transfer; and 3) Promotion of investment and trade partnerships between local businesses and European companies and networks.</narrative>
  </description>
